{
  "book": "1nephi",
  "bookName": "1 Nephi",
  "chapter": 3,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 383.125,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.226,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I, Nephi, returned from speaking with the Lord,",
      "verse": "3:1",
      "lineIndex": 0
    },
    {
      "start": 4.406,
      "end": 6.078,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to the tent of my father.",
      "verse": "3:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 6.758,
      "end": 9.869,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he spake unto me, saying:",
      "verse": "3:2",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 10.049,
      "end": 12.278,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold I have dreamed a dream,",
      "verse": "3:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 12.458,
      "end": 17.566,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in the which the Lord hath commanded me that thou and thy brethren shall return to Jerusalem.",
      "verse": "3:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 18.246,
      "end": 21.311,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, Laban hath the record of the Jews",
      "verse": "3:3",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 21.491,
      "end": 23.999,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also a genealogy of my forefathers,",
      "verse": "3:3",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 24.179,
      "end": 27.058,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they are engraven upon plates of brass.",
      "verse": "3:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 27.738,
      "end": 35.076,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, the Lord hath commanded me that thou and thy brothers should go unto the house of Laban,",
      "verse": "3:4",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 35.256,
      "end": 36.881,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and seek the records,",
      "verse": "3:4",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 37.061,
      "end": 39.987,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and bring them down hither into the wilderness.",
      "verse": "3:4",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 40.667,
      "end": 43.082,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, behold thy brothers murmur,",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 43.262,
      "end": 46.513,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "saying it is a hard thing which I have required of them;",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 46.693,
      "end": 49.108,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but behold I have not required it of them,",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 49.288,
      "end": 51.517,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but it is a commandment of the Lord.",
      "verse": "3:5",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 52.197,
      "end": 53.822,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore go, my son,",
      "verse": "3:6",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 54.002,
      "end": 56.649,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thou shalt be favored of the Lord,",
      "verse": "3:6",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 56.829,
      "end": 58.965,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because thou hast not murmured.",
      "verse": "3:6",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 59.645,
      "end": 62.849,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that I, Nephi, said unto my father:",
      "verse": "3:7",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 63.029,
      "end": 66.373,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will go and do the things which the Lord hath commanded,",
      "verse": "3:7",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 66.553,
      "end": 71.197,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I know that the Lord giveth no commandments unto the children of men,",
      "verse": "3:7",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 71.377,
      "end": 73.653,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save he shall prepare a way for them",
      "verse": "3:7",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 73.833,
      "end": 77.316,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they may accomplish the thing which he commandeth them.",
      "verse": "3:7",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 77.996,
      "end": 81.572,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when my father had heard these words",
      "verse": "3:8",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 81.752,
      "end": 83.517,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he was exceedingly glad,",
      "verse": "3:8",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 83.697,
      "end": 86.855,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he knew that I had been blessed of the Lord.",
      "verse": "3:8",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 87.535,
      "end": 92.133,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I, Nephi, and my brethren took our journey in the wilderness, with our tents,",
      "verse": "3:9",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 92.313,
      "end": 94.542,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to go up to the land of Jerusalem.",
      "verse": "3:9",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 95.222,
      "end": 100.145,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when we had gone up to the land of Jerusalem,",
      "verse": "3:10",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 100.325,
      "end": 103.065,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I and my brethren did consult one with another.",
      "verse": "3:10",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 103.745,
      "end": 105.185,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And we cast lots\u2014",
      "verse": "3:11",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 105.365,
      "end": 108.523,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who of us should go in unto the house of Laban.",
      "verse": "3:11",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 108.703,
      "end": 111.907,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the lot fell upon Laman;",
      "verse": "3:11",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 112.087,
      "end": 114.966,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and Laman went in unto the house of Laban,",
      "verse": "3:11",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 115.146,
      "end": 117.514,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he talked with him as he sat in his house.",
      "verse": "3:11",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 118.194,
      "end": 123.488,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he desired of Laban the records which were engraven upon the plates of brass,",
      "verse": "3:12",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 123.668,
      "end": 126.547,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which contained the genealogy of my father.",
      "verse": "3:12",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 127.227,
      "end": 130.664,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, it came to pass that Laban was angry,",
      "verse": "3:13",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 130.844,
      "end": 133.166,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thrust him out from his presence;",
      "verse": "3:13",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 133.346,
      "end": 136.272,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he would not that he should have the records.",
      "verse": "3:13",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 136.452,
      "end": 138.402,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, he said unto him:",
      "verse": "3:13",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 138.582,
      "end": 141.322,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold thou art a robber, and I will slay thee.",
      "verse": "3:13",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 142.002,
      "end": 144.185,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But Laman fled out of his presence,",
      "verse": "3:14",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 144.365,
      "end": 147.848,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and told the things which Laban had done, unto us.",
      "verse": "3:14",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 148.028,
      "end": 150.675,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And we began to be exceedingly sorrowful,",
      "verse": "3:14",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 150.855,
      "end": 156.242,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and my brethren were about to return unto my father in the wilderness.",
      "verse": "3:14",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 156.922,
      "end": 159.012,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold I said unto them that:",
      "verse": "3:15",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 159.192,
      "end": 160.817,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "As the Lord liveth,",
      "verse": "3:15",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 160.997,
      "end": 162.39,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and as we live,",
      "verse": "3:15",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 162.57,
      "end": 166.796,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we will not go down unto our father in the wilderness",
      "verse": "3:15",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 166.976,
      "end": 171.434,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "until we have accomplished the thing which the Lord hath commanded us.",
      "verse": "3:15",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 172.114,
      "end": 175.829,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, let us be faithful in keeping the commandments of the Lord;",
      "verse": "3:16",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 176.009,
      "end": 180.421,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore let us go down to the land of our father's inheritance,",
      "verse": "3:16",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 180.601,
      "end": 182.969,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold he left gold and silver,",
      "verse": "3:16",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 183.149,
      "end": 184.96,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all manner of riches.",
      "verse": "3:16",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 185.14,
      "end": 188.205,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And all this he hath done because of the commandments of the Lord.",
      "verse": "3:16",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 188.885,
      "end": 193.947,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For he knew that Jerusalem must be destroyed, because of the wickedness of the people.",
      "verse": "3:17",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 194.627,
      "end": 197.785,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, they have rejected the words of the prophets.",
      "verse": "3:18",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 197.965,
      "end": 201.169,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, if my father should dwell in the land",
      "verse": "3:18",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 201.349,
      "end": 204.739,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "after he hath been commanded to flee out of the land,",
      "verse": "3:18",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 204.919,
      "end": 206.916,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, he would also perish.",
      "verse": "3:18",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 207.096,
      "end": 210.672,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, it must needs be that he flee out of the land.",
      "verse": "3:18",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 211.352,
      "end": 216.275,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, it is wisdom in God that we should obtain these records,",
      "verse": "3:19",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 216.455,
      "end": 220.588,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that we may preserve unto our children the language of our fathers;",
      "verse": "3:19",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 221.268,
      "end": 227.862,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And also that we may preserve unto them the words which have been spoken by the mouth of all the holy prophets,",
      "verse": "3:20",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 228.042,
      "end": 235.565,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which have been delivered unto them by the Spirit and power of God, since the world began,",
      "verse": "3:20",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 235.745,
      "end": 237.881,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even down unto this present time.",
      "verse": "3:20",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 238.561,
      "end": 247.756,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that after this manner of language did I persuade my brethren, that they might be faithful in keeping the commandments of God.",
      "verse": "3:21",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 248.436,
      "end": 253.312,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that we went down to the land of our inheritance,",
      "verse": "3:22",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 253.492,
      "end": 257.114,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we did gather together our gold, and our silver,",
      "verse": "3:22",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 257.294,
      "end": 259.059,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and our precious things.",
      "verse": "3:22",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 259.739,
      "end": 262.618,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after we had gathered these things together,",
      "verse": "3:23",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 262.798,
      "end": 265.538,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we went up again unto the house of Laban.",
      "verse": "3:23",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 266.218,
      "end": 270.444,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that we went in unto Laban, and desired him",
      "verse": "3:24",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 270.624,
      "end": 273.085,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he would give unto us the records",
      "verse": "3:24",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 273.265,
      "end": 276.005,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which were engraven upon the plates of brass,",
      "verse": "3:24",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 276.185,
      "end": 280.179,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for which we would give unto him our gold, and our silver,",
      "verse": "3:24",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 280.359,
      "end": 282.17,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all our precious things.",
      "verse": "3:24",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 282.85,
      "end": 286.333,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when Laban saw our property,",
      "verse": "3:25",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 286.513,
      "end": 292.272,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that it was exceedingly great, he did lust after it, insomuch that he thrust us out,",
      "verse": "3:25",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 292.452,
      "end": 294.588,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and sent his servants to slay us,",
      "verse": "3:25",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 294.768,
      "end": 297.183,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he might obtain our property.",
      "verse": "3:25",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 297.863,
      "end": 301.95,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that we did flee before the servants of Laban,",
      "verse": "3:26",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 302.13,
      "end": 304.87,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we were obliged to leave behind our property,",
      "verse": "3:26",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 305.05,
      "end": 307.418,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it fell into the hands of Laban.",
      "verse": "3:26",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 308.098,
      "end": 311.024,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that we fled into the wilderness,",
      "verse": "3:27",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 311.204,
      "end": 314.083,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the servants of Laban did not overtake us,",
      "verse": "3:27",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 314.263,
      "end": 317.467,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and we hid ourselves in the cavity of a rock.",
      "verse": "3:27",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 318.147,
      "end": 321.166,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that Laman was angry with me,",
      "verse": "3:28",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 321.346,
      "end": 323.204,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also with my father;",
      "verse": "3:28",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 323.384,
      "end": 325.056,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also was Lemuel,",
      "verse": "3:28",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 325.236,
      "end": 327.651,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he hearkened unto the words of Laman.",
      "verse": "3:28",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 327.831,
      "end": 331.825,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore Laman and Lemuel did speak many hard words unto us,",
      "verse": "3:28",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 332.005,
      "end": 333.63,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "their younger brothers,",
      "verse": "3:28",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 333.81,
      "end": 336.411,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did smite us even with a rod.",
      "verse": "3:28",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 337.091,
      "end": 340.295,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass as they smote us with a rod,",
      "verse": "3:29",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 340.475,
      "end": 343.819,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, an angel of the Lord came and stood before them,",
      "verse": "3:29",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 343.999,
      "end": 345.996,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he spake unto them, saying:",
      "verse": "3:29",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 346.176,
      "end": 348.962,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Why do ye smite your younger brother with a rod?",
      "verse": "3:29",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 349.142,
      "end": 353.043,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Know ye not that the Lord hath chosen him to be a ruler over you,",
      "verse": "3:29",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 353.223,
      "end": 355.499,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and this because of your iniquities?",
      "verse": "3:29",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 355.679,
      "end": 358.326,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold ye shall go up to Jerusalem again,",
      "verse": "3:29",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 358.506,
      "end": 361.478,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the Lord will deliver Laban into your hands.",
      "verse": "3:29",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 362.158,
      "end": 365.084,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after the angel had spoken unto us, he departed.",
      "verse": "3:30",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 365.764,
      "end": 367.993,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after the angel had departed,",
      "verse": "3:31",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 368.173,
      "end": 371.61,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Laman and Lemuel again began to murmur, saying:",
      "verse": "3:31",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 371.79,
      "end": 375.598,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "How is it possible that the Lord will deliver Laban into our hands?",
      "verse": "3:31",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 375.778,
      "end": 379.029,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, he is a mighty man, and he can command fifty,",
      "verse": "3:31",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 379.209,
      "end": 382.46,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even he can slay fifty; then why not us?",
      "verse": "3:31",
      "lineIndex": 114
    }
  ]
}